Subject: Cantor Self Work Update Broker B0 Protocol Justification

@ [justification_uuid] a0885c31-239c-4567-aa78-7b3d12e94935

& [Claim]
  + pure B0 protocol validation is the smallest executable prerequisite that advances SWA-04B without inventing physical authority

& [Support]
  + parent formation explicitly selects B0 first
  + current source fixes exact stage capability evidence and unresolved semantics
  + current dependencies and sibling canonical helpers make deterministic strict validation feasible

& [AlternativesRejected]
  + direct B1 or B2 is unsigned and lacks current host containment proof
  + generic future-stage receipts create authority laundering risk
  + a documentation-only continuation would not provide executable protocol evidence
  + a new crate or dependency broadens the surface without need

& [Invalidation]
  + any later-stage constructor physical contact capability grant generic effect surface dependency change or downstream authority inference

& [Decision]
  + sign and implement only the exact pure module boundary if all gates close
